	(text "HARDWARE v2  -  GPIO PIN MAPPING\n\nTRANSMITTER                      RECEIVER\nGPIO 0  CONNECTED LED (solid)     GPIO 0   CONNECTED LED (solid)\nGPIO 7  SEARCHING LED (flash)     GPIO 7   SEARCHING LED (flash)\nGPIO 1  Switch 1 input  -->       GPIO 8   CH1 Output (MOSFET, 5A max)\nGPIO 2  Switch 2 input  -->       GPIO 9   CH2 Output (MOSFET, 5A max)\nGPIO 3  Switch 3 input  -->       GPIO 10  CH3 Output (MOSFET, 5A max)\nGPIO 4  Switch 4 input  -->       GPIO 11  CH4 Output (MOSFET, 5A max)\nGPIO 5  Switch 5 input  -->       GPIO 12  CH5 Output (Relay K2, SPDT)\n\nSafety: all RX outputs forced OFF on link loss (timeout 2 s)\nFirmware: firmware/tx_main.py  |  firmware/rx_main.py"
